                "Scoring Guide — A dimension-by-dimension scoring rubric that converts raw survey responses into five dimension scores and one overall campus climate score on a 100-point scale. Schools below 60 overall are classified as Priority Improvement; 60–74 as Developing; 75–89 as Proficient; 90+ as Exemplary.\n\n"
