                "HOW TO USE IT AT YOUR SCHOOL\n\n"
                "The Ally Coalition recommends administering the survey in the fall, using the results to prioritize one or two improvement initiatives, implementing those initiatives during the spring, and re-administering in the spring of the following year to measure change. Schools that use the survey as part of a multi-year improvement plan consistently show measurable climate improvement within two academic years."
