                "Name and Pronoun Policies — Covers the range of name and pronoun policies that schools have adopted, from legally mandated policies (in states with explicit trans student protections) to school-choice policies (in states without explicit requirements). Explains what schools can and cannot require in terms of parental consent for name changes in school records, and how to navigate a situation where a teacher refuses to use a student's correct name or pronouns.\n\n"
