                "Medical Privacy and HIPAA for Minors — Guidance on what medical information schools are entitled to request, what they are not, how HIPAA applies in a school context, and specifically what a student's rights are around disclosure of gender-affirming care. This section is particularly important for school nurses and counselors.\n\n"
                "State-by-State Annotations — A reference table covering all 50 states, noting whether the state has explicit trans student protections (and what they cover), whether the state has laws restricting trans student rights (and in what areas), and where to find the most current state-level legal resources.\n\n"
