                "Monthly Reflection Prompt Series — A set of 10 reflection prompts educators can use independently or in a small learning community to sustain and deepen their allyship practice throughout the year. Prompts address common challenges: what to do when you make a mistake in front of students, how to handle a parent complaint, how to raise trans inclusion in a department meeting, how to support a trans colleague.\n\n"
                "Program Coordinator Guide — Instructions for the school administrator or GSA advisor who runs the pledge program: how to launch it, how to recognize and celebrate educators who pledge, how to track participation, and how to use pledge participation as a data point in school-wide climate assessment.\n\n"
